<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Food Donation</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>
        <div class="main-content">
            <section class="donation-info">
            <h1>Food Donation</h1>
            <p>Food insecurity is a serious issue, and every little bit of help counts. At ServeSmile, we aim to connect people who are in need of food with those who are able to donate. If you have food to spare, or if you're in need, we are here to help.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="donation-buttons">
            <a href="/donate" class="button donate">Donate Food</a>
            <a href="/request" class="button request">Request Food</a>
        </section>
        </div>
        
    </main>
    
</body>
</html>
